ERR-ANALYS (ERR-S)   Statistics (HPGe detector and fission chamber
           (ERR-SYS) Total systematic uncertainty
           (ERR-1)             HPGe efficiency              (2.5%)
           (ERR-2)             Multiple scattering correction (1%)
           (ERR-3)             Fission chamber efficiency   (0.5%)
           (ERR-4)             Mass areal density of uranium(0.2%)
           (MONIT-ERR,1.3,1.5) Monitor cross section    (1.3-1.5%)
